*> vybe-test: cobol/redefines/test_redefines_multiple
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_redefines.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-BASE PIC X(4) VALUE "AAAA".
01 WS-ALIAS1 REDEFINES WS-BASE PIC 9(4).
01 WS-ALIAS2 REDEFINES WS-BASE PIC X(4).
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    MOVE "4444" TO WS-ALIAS2.
    DISPLAY WS-ALIAS1.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-ALIAS1 DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "4444"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [4444] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY WS-ALIAS2.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-ALIAS2 DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "4444"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [4444] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

